    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can surge the power of a Vehicle's shields through your direct data link at precisely the right moment to reduce the damage to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> from incoming enemy fire.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cyborg_Hybrid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cyborg Hybrid\">Cyborg Hybrid</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, when your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> takes damage above its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a>, after the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a> is reduced you can reduce the amount of damage sustained by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> by an amount up to the remaining <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a>. However, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Shield_Rating\" title=\"Shield Rating\">Shield Rating</a> is immediately reduced by one point for every point of damage reduced.</p><p><b>Special:</b> The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Recharge_Shields\" title=\"Recharge Shields\">Recharge Shields</a> Action cannot be used on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> until a full round after the use of Shield Surge. You must have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scomp_Link\" title=\"Scomp Link\">Scomp Link</a> or similar direct data link to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> to use this Feat.</p>",
